<opml version="2.0">
  <head><title>The campaign calendar</title><_calendar>{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;vale&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Calendar of the Vale&quot;,&quot;epochDay&quot;:0,&quot;months&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Firstfrost&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Deepwinter&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Thawing&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Seedfall&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Greening&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Highsun&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Goldencrest&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Emberwane&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Harvestide&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Fallowmoon&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mistfall&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Longnight&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30}],&quot;week&quot;:{&quot;length&quot;:7,&quot;days&quot;:[&quot;Moonday&quot;,&quot;Tilday&quot;,&quot;Windday&quot;,&quot;Seaday&quot;,&quot;Hearthday&quot;,&quot;Forgeday&quot;,&quot;Restday&quot;]},&quot;eras&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;AE&quot;,&quot;yearZero&quot;:1200}],&quot;current&quot;:1181}</_calendar><_calendars>{&quot;vale&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;vale&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Calendar of the Vale&quot;,&quot;epochDay&quot;:0,&quot;months&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Firstfrost&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Deepwinter&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Thawing&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Seedfall&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Greening&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Highsun&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Goldencrest&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Emberwane&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Harvestide&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Fallowmoon&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Mistfall&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Longnight&quot;,&quot;days&quot;:30}],&quot;week&quot;:{&quot;length&quot;:7,&quot;days&quot;:[&quot;Moonday&quot;,&quot;Tilday&quot;,&quot;Windday&quot;,&quot;Seaday&quot;,&quot;Hearthday&quot;,&quot;Forgeday&quot;,&quot;Restday&quot;]},&quot;eras&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;AE&quot;,&quot;yearZero&quot;:1200}],&quot;current&quot;:1181}}</_calendars><_gamelog>{&quot;targetId&quot;:&quot;3ssv31f4&quot;,&quot;calendarId&quot;:&quot;vale&quot;}</_gamelog></head>
  <body>
    <outline text="# The Salt Road" _id="il98dwyi">
      <outline text="A caravan campaign running on its own calendar. It is {= asdate(today)}. Advance the clock from the agenda's Today chip (the toolbar calendar button) and this line follows it. See campaign-calendar.md for the walkthrough." _id="m2r3yetk"/>
    </outline>
    <outline text="## Threads on the road" _id="9ptdbssb">
      <outline text="Each thread carries a due date in WORLD time. Open the agenda and the urgency colors count from the calendar's clock, not your computer's. Advance the clock and watch the drovers' payday go red." _id="4na0goot"/>
      <outline text="#TODO [#A] Reach the Highsun ford before the toll doubles #thread" _props="[{&quot;key&quot;:&quot;due&quot;,&quot;val&quot;:&quot;1204-04-18&quot;}]" _id="khesg973"/>
      <outline text="#WAITING The brokers' answer from the Vale #thread" _props="[{&quot;key&quot;:&quot;due&quot;,&quot;val&quot;:&quot;1204-04-15&quot;}]" _id="a4hizwrq"/>
      <outline text="#TODO Pay the drovers #thread" _props="[{&quot;key&quot;:&quot;due&quot;,&quot;val&quot;:&quot;1204-04-13&quot;}]" _id="p80w35wv"/>
      <outline text="The board, always current: {query: #thread}" _id="3rfcn5os"/>
    </outline>
    <outline text="## The road deck" _id="ikbnikia">
      <outline text="Draw one event per travel day, no repeats until the deck runs dry: {shuffle: a broken axle|a toll post ahead|dust on the horizon|a stranger asks to join the column|wolves at dusk|clear roads and good water}" _id="q81303mt"/>
    </outline>
    <outline text="Chronicle of the Salt Road" _id="3ssv31f4">
      <outline text="A chronicle is the log that reads in WORLD time: its dates are the calendar's, and the Chronicle button in the toolbar files an entry under the day you steer to. The journal is the other one, and it stays real: it records the day you actually wrote, so /journal here opens a Journal point dated in your own calendar, not the Vale's. Two logs, two calendars, one document." _id="chr00010"/>
      <outline text="1204" _id="xlm4g5l9">
        <outline text="04" _id="cmdvi6ix">
          <outline text="12" _id="0nnc2elf">
            <outline text="The caravan formed up at the Vale gate. Twelve wagons, the salt sealed, Mother Casks counting barrels twice. The brokers promised an answer by the 15th." _id="15omhcbd"/>
          </outline>
        </outline>
      </outline>
    </outline>
  </body>
</opml>